        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI Codex Aids Business, Data Teams",
          "zh": "OpenAI Codex 助力业务和数据团队"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI's Codex is utilized by business operations and data science teams to generate various operational documents and analytical reports from existing work inputs.",
          "zh": "OpenAI的Codex被业务运营和数据科学团队用于从现有工作输入中生成各类运营文件和分析报告。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Business operations teams leverage Codex to create initiative briefs, strategy updates, and leadership decision packets.",
            "Data science teams utilize Codex to build root-cause briefs, impact readouts, and KPI memos.",
            "Codex generates these varied documents for both functions by processing \"real work inputs\"."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "业务运营团队利用Codex创建倡议简报、战略更新和领导决策包。",
            "数据科学团队运用Codex构建根本原因简报、影响解读和关键绩效指标备忘录。",
            "Codex通过处理“真实工作输入”为这两种职能生成各种文档。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The application of AI tools like Codex streamlines documentation creation for core business and analytical functions. This can enhance efficiency by automating the drafting of reports and strategic communications within enterprises.",
          "zh": "Codex等AI工具的应用简化了核心业务和分析职能的文档创建流程。这可以通过自动化企业内部报告和战略沟通的起草来提高效率。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-data-science-teams-use-codex"
      },
      {
        "title": {
