          "zh": "OpenAI与马耳他合作推广全国性人工智能普及"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI has partnered with Malta to provide ChatGPT Plus access and AI training to all Maltese citizens.",
          "zh": "OpenAI与马耳他建立合作关系，旨在向所有马耳他公民提供ChatGPT Plus访问权限及人工智能培训。"
        },
