        "title": {
          "en": "arXiv Implements Year-Long Ban for AI-Generated Submissions",
          "zh": "arXiv 对提交AI生成内容的作者实施一年禁令"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "arXiv will ban submitters of AI-generated content, described as 'hallucinations' or 'slop,' for a year.",
          "zh": "arXiv 将对提交AI生成内容（被称为“幻觉”或“糟粕”）的作者处以一年禁令。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Submitting AI-generated content to arXiv will result in a one-year ban from further submissions.",
            "The new policy targets AI-generated materials described as 'hallucinations' or 'slop.'",
            "An arXiv moderator announced the policy on social media due to an influx of such content."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "向 arXiv 提交AI生成内容将导致一年内无法再次提交。",
            "新政策旨在处理被描述为“幻觉”或“糟粕”的AI生成材料。",
            "一位arXiv版主在社交媒体上宣布了这项政策，以应对此类内容的涌入。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This policy change reflects the growing challenge academic preprint servers face in maintaining research integrity amidst an influx of AI-generated content. It sets a precedent for how scientific platforms manage submissions from advanced generative AI tools.",
          "zh": "这项政策变化反映了学术预印本服务器在AI生成内容涌入的情况下，维护研究诚信所面临的日益严峻的挑战。它为科学平台如何管理来自高级生成式AI工具的投稿设定了先例。"
        },
        "source": "404 Media",
        "link": "https://www.404media.co/new-arxiv-rules-ai-generated-papers-ban/"
